---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="zh-CN">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Spark Relics</title>
	</head>
	<body class="min-h-screen bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 antialiased">
		<main class="mx-auto flex min-h-screen w-full max-w-5xl flex-col justify-center px-6 py-16">
			<p class="mb-4 inline-flex w-fit rounded-full border border-cyan-400/40 bg-cyan-400/10 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-cyan-300">
				Spark Relics Official Site
			</p>
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">
				点亮每一段灵感，沉淀每一份价值。
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
				这是基于 Astro + Tailwind CSS 搭建的官网初始化页面，仓库可通过 GitHub Actions 自动构建并部署到 GitHub Pages。
			</p>
			<div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
				<a
					class="rounded-lg bg-cyan-400 px-5 py-3 font-medium text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-cyan-300"
					href="https://github.com/spark-relics/spark-relics.github.io"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noreferrer"
				>
					查看 GitHub 仓库
				</a>
				<a
					class="rounded-lg border border-slate-700 px-5 py-3 font-medium text-slate-100 transition hover:border-slate-500 hover:bg-slate-900"
					href="https://spark-relics.github.io/"
				>
					访问官网地址
				</a>
			</div>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
